This list contains the optimal settings for a number of games under PC64.

The names match as close as possible the original title screens.

Some names are starting with a space. This little trick will move the file
to the beginning of the directory. It isn't necessary for disk images
because they are not sorted.

Sequels of a game my be spread over the whole doc file.

The setting "For slow graphic cards: Update screen every xth vertical
refresh" means that this game is changing big portions of the screen, e.g.
scrolling background patterns. This will strain the PC46 screen cache.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------

JIFFY601.64K (JIFFYDOS V6.01, alternate KERNAL)
    These required patches will disable the fastloader:
    1FA5: 4C AA FB -> 4C 13 EE
    11B5: 4C AA FB -> 4C 13 EE
    14E0: 20 79 F1 -> 20 13 EE
    14FB: 20 AA FB -> 20 13 EE

    This recomended patch will shorten the RAM test:
    1D83: C8 D0 E8 -> 4C 6C FD

BELOW THE ROOT
ALICE IN WONDERLAND
    - Joystick #2

    Uses an unsupported IEC mode with a query of the EOF bit at $382C. Runs
    if you issue the following patch (BTR Disk 1, AIW Disk 2):
    24 90 50 F9 -> 24 90 EA EA

9 PRINCES IN AMB (Nine Princes In Amber)
AMAZON
DRAGONWORLD
FARENHEIT 451
PERRY MASON
TREASURE ISLAND
WIZARD OF OZ
    - Switch off national keyboard driver
    - No joysticks

    In these Windham/Telarium adventures you must press the Space key at
    the beginning within one second. As own keyboard tables are defined
    at address $0A05, <Options / Keyboard / Use national keyboard driver>
    must be off. Otherwise all letters will be upcase and Backspace won't
    work. Loader files and disk names may be renamed.

MASQUERADE
    - No joysticks

    Pictures are not displayed, the message NOT A MASQUERADE PICTURE DISK
    appears. The game uses an own copy of the IEC routines at $2D09 with
    other zero page addresses.

ASYLUM
    - No joysticks
    - Start of interrupt consumes -10 cycles

    Only the cracked version runs. The original game has NETLoc copy
    protection and SpeeDOS fastloader.

FORT APOCALYPSE
    - Joystick #2

COMMANDO
SPACE INVASION
    - Joystick #2 with autofire

    Commando is the Englisch original version. In the German version, the
    Nazis have been replaced by aliens.

