    - Enable char and sprite DMA

IMPOSSIBLE MISS.
    - Joystick #2
    - VIC[12h]: Report new line at 100 percent
    - Set FM volume to 11

    If you destroy the orb by driving it into a robot, your hero also dies.
    Prevent this by setting <Options / Timing / Update screen every nth
    vertical refresh> temporarily to 1 (or permanently if you have a
    Pentium).

